      "content": "Look for individuals who are constantly scanning their surroundings, darting their eyes around rather than maintaining a steady gaze. People who are aggressively territorial, such as pacing or blocking pathways unnecessarily, are also red flags. Furthermore, watch for groups where one person seems to be directing or controlling the others, suggesting a coordinated intent. These specific actions often signal underlying tension or pre-meditation.",
